Output assets/demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1200
Set Height 590
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Builtin Solarized Light"
Set TypingSpeed 16ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1
Hide
Type "toolcall-check --demo-broken --output broken-report"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 6s
Type "toolcall-check --demo --output healthy-report"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 5s
